    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations, or ankle swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No weakness, numbness, speech trouble, or dizziness</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No transient loss of vision in either eye</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low at times and ashamed when recognized; no thoughts of self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
